### Get all diary entries
GET http://localhost:3000/api/diaries

### Get single diary entry by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/diaries/1

### Add new valid diary entry
POST http://localhost:3000/api/diaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-06-01",
  "weather": "sunny",
  "visibility": "good",
  "comment": "nice day"
}

### Invalid weather - should return 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/diaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-06-01",
  "weather": "tornado",
  "visibility": "good",
  "comment": "test"
}

### Invalid date format - should return 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/diaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "01-06-2026",
  "weather": "sunny",
  "visibility": "good",
  "comment": "test"
}

### Missing field (comment) - should return 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/diaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-06-01",
  "weather": "sunny",
  "visibility": "good"
}

### Empty body - should return 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/diaries
Content-Type: application/json

{}